{
  "uid": "k8s-gateway",
  "title": "19 · Gateway del Collector en Kubernetes",
  "description": "Salud del gateway (Deployment con tail sampling) desplegado con Helm: réplicas, flujo de spans, trazas en memoria, descartes tempranos y memoria. Fuente: el Prometheus del chart prom-lab (job otel-gateway).",
  "tags": [
    "curso",
    "kubernetes",
    "helm",
    "collector"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cómo leer este dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "transparent": false,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Las métricas son la **telemetría interna** de cada réplica del gateway (`:8888`), raspada por DNS del Service headless `otel-gateway-headless`. Se espera: **réplicas** estables (y que el HPA las cambie despacio), **aceptados ≫ enviados** (el resto es lo muestreado), **trazas en memoria** ≈ tráfico × `decision_wait` y **descartes tempranos = 0**."
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Réplicas y flujo",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Réplicas del gateway listas",
      "description": "Número de réplicas con up=1 (objetivo ≥ 2 para el PDB minAvailable: 1).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count(up{job=\"otel-gateway\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "sin datos",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Spans aceptados vs enviados (por segundo)",
      "description": "La diferencia es lo que el tail sampling descartó (con la política del curso se conserva ≈ 20-25 % de los spans).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 18,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans{job=\"otel-gateway\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "aceptados",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_sent_spans{job=\"otel-gateway\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "enviados a Tempo",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "id": 4
